## Why This Is Asked

Assesses end-to-end testing across streaming ingestion, caching, and downstream failover. Focuses on exactly-once semantics, idempotency, late data handling, cache resilience, and disaster recovery in a realistic real-time analytics workflow.

## Key Concepts

- End-to-end streaming tests across POST, stream, and GET paths
- Exactly-once delivery and idempotent submissions
- Watermarking and late-arrival handling
- Cache stampede protection and eviction policies
- Partial downstream outages and replay strategies

